WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.920
Ikite ikite ikitsukuse

00:00:04.920 --> 00:00:09.380
Hikari o mirai e

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:23.290
Uragirareta kodoku na sekai ni torinokosare

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.830
Miushinatta ashita o osorete ima mo

00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.960
Ibasho o sagasu

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:38.460
Hitsuyou to saretai kokoro no sakebi

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:47.210
Karamiau IDENTITY tashikametainda shinjite iikana

00:00:47.210 --> 00:00:50.580
Ikite ikite ikitsukuse

00:00:50.580 --> 00:00:54.580
Hikari o mirai e

00:00:54.920 --> 00:00:58.080
Tatoe subete ushinattemo

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:02.500
Kibou o tsunaide

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:06.170
Boku ga koko ni iru imi

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:10.040
Ima wa wakaranakute mo ii

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:13.920
Kimi to waraiaeru you ni

00:01:13.920 --> 00:01:19.830
Jibun de tachikitte susumudake

00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:45.880
<b>I'm Quitting Heroing</b>

00:01:54.580 --> 00:01:55.750
Guess I lost.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.830
Feels nice.

00:02:25.250 --> 00:02:26.250
Leo...

00:02:32.420 --> 00:02:36.710
Did you enjoy that farce?
Pretending to be the evil Demon King?

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:40.670
Yeah, it was pretty fun.

00:02:41.710 --> 00:02:47.420
I've always wanted to be the villain.
I'm glad I got to do it with you.

00:02:47.880 --> 00:02:49.630
You went easy on us.

00:02:50.540 --> 00:02:51.540
Did I, now?

00:02:51.540 --> 00:02:54.960
Don't play dumb! You let my spell hit you!

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:59.580
Should I have dodged it?
You guys were losing pretty bad.

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:04.830
You wanted to lose, from the very start.

00:03:05.500 --> 00:03:07.710
You came here hoping we would defeat you.

00:03:08.040 --> 00:03:09.080
I guess.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:16.790
Can't say it all went according to plan,
but you did disable me before I killed everyone.

00:03:17.130 --> 00:03:21.670
Your little game nearly took the lives
of all five of us, you bloody fool!

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:28.040
From the start? When would that be?

00:03:28.330 --> 00:03:30.290
How far back does that go?

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:34.330
I asked you before why you joined us.

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.880
If humanity had betrayed you,
or you wanted to put an end to the world,

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:42.040
or if you'd come seeking a place to die.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:45.130
What a foolish answer this is.

00:03:46.420 --> 00:03:50.040
Now, this belongs to you.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.250
The Philosopher's Stone.

00:03:52.460 --> 00:03:57.290
I used an emergency override
to cut me off from the Stone's energy.

00:03:58.080 --> 00:04:01.920
You've only got 300 seconds, so don't dilly-dally.

00:04:02.330 --> 00:04:04.830
I can only do this once.

00:04:05.250 --> 00:04:07.290
So we just pull it out?

00:04:07.630 --> 00:04:12.830
Yep. It's in pretty tight,
but it's just like popping a cap off a bottle.

00:04:15.500 --> 00:04:20.380
No! Don't! Please don't kill Leo!

00:04:20.580 --> 00:04:25.210
Stop it, Echidna! Don't kill him, please!

00:04:25.210 --> 00:04:29.500
Come, Lily, don't make a fuss. Queen Echidna is unwell.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:33.580
No! Leo, don't die!

00:04:43.460 --> 00:04:44.630
Look at that smile.

00:04:44.830 --> 00:04:48.830
Till the very end, he's protecting humanity.

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:55.080
He was never going to kill anyone or destroy our worlds.

00:04:56.460 --> 00:05:01.580
He knew he could sacrifice his life to bring
peace to both and willingly made that choice.

00:05:02.710 --> 00:05:08.710
It pains me to admit it, but he truly is a hero,
through and through.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.830
270 seconds left.

00:05:12.710 --> 00:05:14.790
Do you have any regrets?

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:22.380
Someone's picking up my work,
and the Demon Army's running more efficiently.

00:05:23.830 --> 00:05:27.920
Everything's good. I've got no regrets.

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:29.500
All right.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:30.380
No!

00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:34.420
Leo!

00:05:34.710 --> 00:05:36.170
Stop this tantrum!

00:05:36.460 --> 00:05:38.830
No, no, no!

00:05:39.630 --> 00:05:40.500
Lily!

00:05:46.960 --> 00:05:50.710
The Demon World needs the Philosopher's Stone.

00:05:52.420 --> 00:05:55.710
Actually, there's one last thing I have to say.

00:05:59.540 --> 00:06:02.540
Sorry for all the trouble.

00:06:24.460 --> 00:06:26.630
240 seconds, now.

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:32.630
Goodbye, Great Generals. Goodbye, Echidna.

00:06:33.540 --> 00:06:37.380
I'm glad I got to know you all.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:44.540
Hey...

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:47.710
I've changed my mind. It's too much effort.

00:06:47.710 --> 00:06:48.670
What?!

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:52.330
You want me to make peace with the human world?

00:06:52.540 --> 00:06:58.540
You fool! Have you forgotten who I am?
I am the Demon Queen, the great Echidna!

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:01.420
I am the ruler of the Demon World, its queen!

00:07:01.420 --> 00:07:06.580
Do you know how busy I am?
I've no time for this errand of yours!

00:07:07.540 --> 00:07:08.750
What?!

00:07:09.130 --> 00:07:13.630
Now listen, hero... No, now you're merely Leo.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:19.080
Listen, Leo, and rejoice, for I have decided
to officially employ you in my ranks!

00:07:19.420 --> 00:07:24.330
Seeing as you possess the Stone and
are the only being to have lived 3000 years,

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.170
I appoint you as ambassador between
the Demon and Human worlds!

00:07:27.170 --> 00:07:29.880
Are you crazy?! You're running out of time!

00:07:29.880 --> 00:07:30.670
I don't care!

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:34.960
I'd expect nothing less of you, My Queen.

00:07:35.420 --> 00:07:38.420
H-hey, Edvard! Talk some sense into her!

00:07:38.420 --> 00:07:40.670
No, screw that, tear the Stone out of me, now!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.630
Lord Leo, surely you jest!

00:07:45.630 --> 00:07:49.880
I'm afraid I agree with Queen Echidna.
You'd best give up.

00:07:50.170 --> 00:07:51.710
You only have 200 seconds!

00:07:51.830 --> 00:07:55.830
There are still so many things I'd like to learn from
you, Lord Leo!

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:59.630
Your death would be a great disservice! To me, at least!

00:08:01.380 --> 00:08:04.540
How is he this stupid?! It makes no sense!

00:08:04.880 --> 00:08:11.500
Can you think of any other better to unite
our worlds than a man who's lived 3000 years?

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:12.790
I mean...

00:08:17.080 --> 00:08:21.250
And my darling Julietta has taken quite a liking to you!

00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:24.460
What father would I be if I made her cry?

00:08:25.670 --> 00:08:28.290
I beseech you, reconsider your decision!

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:30.040
Do you not have a brain inside that thick skull of yours?!

00:08:30.040 --> 00:08:31.710
You're the one without a brain!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:36.710
Why?! Why did you think of this by yourself
so you can end it by yourself?!

00:08:36.710 --> 00:08:39.210
Why didn't you ask your friends for help?!

00:08:39.500 --> 00:08:42.960
You didn't ask me for help at all!

00:08:43.460 --> 00:08:45.790
Why? Who could I have--

00:08:45.790 --> 00:08:46.540
Me!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:50.330
Talk to me!

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:54.170
You taught me that when you're in trouble,
you should ask your friends for help!

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:56.670
You taught me that when
you can't do it by yourself to find, uh,

00:08:57.000 --> 00:09:01.790
I-I get it, Lily! One of my shortcomings
is my inability to trust people!

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:02.210
Find the right person for the job!

00:09:01.960 --> 00:09:05.080
But this isn't the time for this! You have 160 seconds!

00:09:02.210 --> 00:09:04.000
So why are you doing this?! Look at me and tell me!

00:09:10.250 --> 00:09:16.710
I'm stupid, so I don't know why you want to die...

00:09:17.210 --> 00:09:22.830
But I'll always hear you out,
so please don't die on me, you big dummy!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:30.750
Mernes! He'll be able to calmly analyze the situation!

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:35.040
You've only got 140 seconds left. I trust you, Mernes.

00:09:35.330 --> 00:09:37.670
You won't let your emotions get the better of you.

00:09:38.000 --> 00:09:38.670
OW!

00:09:38.670 --> 00:09:41.330
Are you stupid?

00:09:40.080 --> 00:09:40.960
Ow!

00:09:41.790 --> 00:09:44.130
That hurts! Hey! Stop it!

00:09:44.420 --> 00:09:48.830
I didn't need to be a good listener.
I just needed to fight you.

00:09:49.290 --> 00:09:55.580
Your words, your attitude, your eyes,
everything is screaming that you want to live.

00:09:56.130 --> 00:09:58.540
This whole time, too.

00:09:59.830 --> 00:10:02.710
Then live, you idiot!

00:10:02.960 --> 00:10:04.920
If you want to live, then live!

00:10:06.130 --> 00:10:09.420
You told me to make choices you won't regret.

00:10:10.250 --> 00:10:14.170
But here you are, dying full of regrets.

00:10:14.380 --> 00:10:16.130
You only have 110 seconds!

00:10:15.040 --> 00:10:18.290
Moron! Idiot! Imbecile!

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:19.750
No, no, no, no!

00:10:22.080 --> 00:10:23.960
Sh-Shutina! Help!

00:10:24.540 --> 00:10:26.290
Help with what?

00:10:26.710 --> 00:10:30.630
Leo, have you caught on to
the contradiction in your words?

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:31.830
Wh-what contradiction?

00:10:32.040 --> 00:10:35.420
Tell me, for what reason are you dying?

00:10:35.630 --> 00:10:37.290
What? I don't have time to--

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:38.710
Tell me!

00:10:40.330 --> 00:10:43.670
To protect humanity. That's the order they built into us!

00:10:43.670 --> 00:10:46.000
And none of the Demonhart Series can disobey it!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.710
Another order, Thought Masking, erases
any rebellious thoughts before they develop!

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:52.040
You only have 95 seconds!

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:53.130
But in your case...

00:10:53.130 --> 00:10:56.380
Yes! I developed, I grew a strong ego, a self!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:10:58.710
That self turned off my Thought Masking!

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:02.290
But I can't keep my identity if I don't protect humanity!

00:11:02.420 --> 00:11:07.960
If something doesn't change, I'm going to
put humanity in danger just so I can save them!

00:11:08.330 --> 00:11:09.670
I see, I see.

00:11:09.960 --> 00:11:11.250
That's just how it is!

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:16.630
No matter how strong my ego or sense of free will,
they're not strong enough to...

00:11:17.460 --> 00:11:18.380
That's right.

00:11:18.380 --> 00:11:25.000
By that logic, your strong ego should allow you
to disable your order to protect, yes?

00:11:25.000 --> 00:11:27.210
What? No, it couldn't...

00:11:27.420 --> 00:11:28.290
Try it.

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:29.250
But--

00:11:29.250 --> 00:11:30.380
Try it, now!

00:11:41.080 --> 00:11:42.380
Fine!

00:11:45.380 --> 00:11:47.210
Disable the order?

00:11:50.250 --> 00:11:55.960
Protect humanity from evil. Protect humanity from evil.

00:11:51.500 --> 00:11:53.380
Disable THIS?

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:58.920
Is she stupid?! I've been following this order
for 3000 years! I can't just turn it off!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:58.710
Protect humanity from evil. Protect humanity from evil.

00:11:59.040 --> 00:12:04.420
Protect humanity from evil. Protect humanity from evil.

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:05.380
How am I even supposed to do that?
Just "try it"? Help me out, here!

00:12:04.630 --> 00:12:10.500
Protect humanity from evil. Protect humanity from evil.

00:12:05.670 --> 00:12:07.420
It can't be done! I don't know how!

00:12:08.040 --> 00:12:10.210
Okay, okay, fine!

00:12:10.710 --> 00:12:16.250
Protect humanity from evil. Protect humanity from evil.

00:12:14.170 --> 00:12:17.080
I get it, but could you shut up for a sec?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:22.080
Protect humanity from evil. Protect humanity from evil.

00:12:17.710 --> 00:12:21.000
Just stop, please stop, just STOP.

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.670
Just...

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.130
Protect hum-

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:26.630
Wait.

00:12:27.460 --> 00:12:28.130
Really?

00:12:34.630 --> 00:12:38.540
I disabled it?

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:44.130
I HAVE TO protect the world.

00:12:45.330 --> 00:12:47.790
I HAVE TO be a hero.

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:52.500
There was no way to escape those compulsions.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.080
Did...

00:12:55.130 --> 00:12:57.790
Did I just CONVINCE myself that I HAD to?

00:12:58.500 --> 00:13:00.750
Leo, there are 30 seconds left.

00:13:02.000 --> 00:13:04.630
If you truly want to die, then I will kill you.

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:08.040
It's your life. Use it as you see fit.

00:13:09.210 --> 00:13:14.250
I don't know shit about bioweapons,
but you should live your life the way you want!

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:19.960
But if you want to live, then do not waste
your life trapped by someone else's orders.

00:13:20.580 --> 00:13:25.880
Don't get too caught up in
this 'born to protect humanity' shit!

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:29.580
Humanity has exiled you.
Is this not the perfect opportunity?

00:13:29.750 --> 00:13:35.580
Work under me, and leave 'heroing'
behind for a new way of life.

00:13:36.250 --> 00:13:40.460
If humanity stops needing you, that's your chance!

00:13:40.630 --> 00:13:44.420
Find something else to live for, and enjoy your life!

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.540
Quit heroing and join me!

00:14:20.210 --> 00:14:24.540
Your three thousand years of endless solitude end now.

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:27.210
Leo!

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:23.080
<b>No taking anything out of storage without permission!</b>

00:15:30.960 --> 00:15:35.080
<b>Be a Strong Warrior. Be a Good Boss</b>

00:15:54.960 --> 00:15:57.210
Boy, you guys really let your guards down.

00:15:57.880 --> 00:15:59.080
Foolish indeed.

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:04.830
Sharing wine with the Hero Leo,
then falling asleep in his presence...

00:16:05.130 --> 00:16:07.920
Had you told me of this before, I would have laughed.

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:11.710
I don't see the problem. We're allies now.

00:16:11.960 --> 00:16:14.040
Not allies. You are my subordinate.

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.250
I admit, you had the lot of us hoodwinked this entire time.

00:16:20.250 --> 00:16:24.790
You even gave our Generals a false motive
behind your actions at the start.

00:16:25.420 --> 00:16:27.670
Everything I said happened was the truth,

00:16:28.080 --> 00:16:31.290
but I never harbored any ill will towards humanity.

00:16:31.750 --> 00:16:37.380
From the day of your interview, it wasn't you
who was being tested, but the Demon Army.

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:44.210
Leo, do you have any regrets?

00:16:44.460 --> 00:16:45.500
What do you mean?

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:46.710
Don't dodge the question.

00:16:46.710 --> 00:16:52.580
That was your one chance to die.
You may not get another for centuries.

00:16:53.130 --> 00:16:59.920
Do you regret giving up potentially
your only chance to be freed of your burdens?

00:17:02.920 --> 00:17:04.080
Good question.

00:17:05.460 --> 00:17:08.210
I want to help you.

00:17:08.500 --> 00:17:10.250
Wh-where did this come from?

00:17:10.670 --> 00:17:16.170
Back when we drank together.
When I heard your story, I knew I wanted to help you.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:19.210
I wish to bring order to my world of chaos.

00:17:19.210 --> 00:17:21.420
To rid the land of conflict.

00:17:22.420 --> 00:17:24.750
I want to make your wish come true.

00:17:25.790 --> 00:17:30.500
I want to help you find a way
for humanity and demonkind to coexist.

00:17:31.040 --> 00:17:35.540
That's why I'm here. I don't regret a thing.

00:17:36.250 --> 00:17:38.540
Have you forgotten that I am a villainous conqueror,

00:17:38.750 --> 00:17:43.330
one who invades other worlds
and wreaks havoc for her own gain?

00:17:43.830 --> 00:17:48.290
Do you truly believe working beneath
such a villain would be virtuous?

00:17:48.540 --> 00:17:53.500
None of that's true. You're a kind queen
who cares deeply for her people.

00:17:54.920 --> 00:17:59.710
That kindness drove you to invade
the human world for the sake of your homeland.

00:17:59.710 --> 00:18:03.500
That kindness led you to empathize
with the people you were conquering.

00:18:03.830 --> 00:18:05.920
That's how I beat you.

00:18:06.210 --> 00:18:07.960
You love your people.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:10.710
Conquest doesn't suit you.

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:14.080
Even now, you're asking me
these things out of kindness.

00:18:14.580 --> 00:18:17.420
You want me to know this
is my last chance to reconsider.

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:22.710
But that kindness of yours has saved my life.

00:18:23.210 --> 00:18:25.290
Let me help you, Echidna.

00:18:25.290 --> 00:18:28.960
I'll do everything in my power to ensure
you never have to play the villain again.

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:34.580
To ensure you can be the kind queen
you truly are, for all your people.

00:18:35.330 --> 00:18:36.460
This I swear.

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:39.250
Can I trust you?

00:18:39.790 --> 00:18:41.040
Of course you can.

00:18:41.500 --> 00:18:46.330
In three thousand years, I've never, ever made a girl cry.

00:18:46.330 --> 00:18:47.830
Leo...

00:18:49.790 --> 00:18:51.420
You're all right...

00:18:52.330 --> 00:18:58.830
I guess that's not true. But I'll uphold that promise.

00:19:03.580 --> 00:19:09.460
I was going to give you one last chance,
but it appears I've been misguided.

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:13.540
I hadn't expected you to repay me
with such a purposeful new lease on life...

00:19:14.960 --> 00:19:17.670
But I do like it.

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:20.500
So you accept my answer, then?

00:19:21.080 --> 00:19:21.960
I do.

00:19:23.500 --> 00:19:27.380
I'm looking forward to working with you, former hero Leo.

00:19:27.880 --> 00:19:30.880
It is an honor, Queen Echidna.

00:19:33.210 --> 00:19:37.420
That was the story of how I came
to join the Demon Queen's army.

00:19:38.080 --> 00:19:41.710
Father! Is General Edvard here?

00:19:44.000 --> 00:19:46.630
I am so terribly sorry, Your Highness!

00:19:46.630 --> 00:19:50.380
I deeply apologize for interrupting
your romantic moment with Lord Leo!

00:19:51.210 --> 00:19:54.080
This was NOT a romantic moment, you fool!

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:56.830
Forget that! What did you come here for? Tell me!

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:03.880
Right! The wyverns are dissatisfied with
their treatment and have begun to riot!

00:20:03.880 --> 00:20:05.040
Again?

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:07.790
All right, you lot! Wake up!

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:11.500
My deepest apologies, Your Highness!

00:20:14.210 --> 00:20:15.630
We are awake, my Queen.

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:18.580
Edvard, go deal with them before
they cause any damage!

00:20:18.880 --> 00:20:19.540
At once.

00:20:19.750 --> 00:20:22.710
Scuse me, is General Lily here?

00:20:22.710 --> 00:20:23.750
What's up?

00:20:23.750 --> 00:20:29.290
Largo is complaining that the elixirs that
were due yesterday haven't been delivered.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:30.670
I totally forgot!

00:20:31.330 --> 00:20:32.500
General Shutina!

00:20:32.830 --> 00:20:37.500
One of the tomes in the fourth library has run
amok and is summoning a stream of chimeras!

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:42.250
That accursed tome again! I'm going to burn it
to a crisp, once and for all! Come with me!

00:20:42.420 --> 00:20:44.540
Mernie, I was looking for you!

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:47.880
We can't open the dining hall without you!

00:20:47.880 --> 00:20:49.710
I told you I was quitting.

00:20:48.250 --> 00:20:51.250
I know, I know, but let's talk later! Come, now!

00:20:51.250 --> 00:20:54.630
Queen Echidna, what should we
do about the Great Spirit Portal?

00:20:54.630 --> 00:20:58.250
Queen Echidna, we've received a message
from the viceroy in the Demon World!

00:20:58.250 --> 00:20:59.540
Queen Echidna!

00:20:59.540 --> 00:21:06.170
Now, Leo, I believe you said you would
do everything in your power to help me.

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.500
Is that right?

00:21:07.500 --> 00:21:09.750
Yeah, that's what I said.

00:21:10.290 --> 00:21:13.500
As you can see, we have mountains of work to do.

00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:17.790
Before we take on the large-scale issue
of uniting the human and demon realms,

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:20.960
we'll need to tackle the problems we're currently facing.

00:21:21.130 --> 00:21:24.460
I intend to make full use of your talents, so do be ready.

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:26.540
Don't need to tell me twice.

00:21:26.960 --> 00:21:30.960
I'll take care of it, so you sit back and have some tea.

00:21:33.170 --> 00:21:37.380
That was the story of how I came
to join the Demon Queen's army.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:43.170
How the Hero Leo, a biological weapon
created three thousand years ago,

00:21:43.460 --> 00:21:47.750
broke free of his ancient commands
to move forward on his own.

00:21:49.080 --> 00:21:51.580
How he made a great many friends.

00:21:53.210 --> 00:21:55.710
Friends he could trust.

00:21:58.040 --> 00:22:02.710
How I finally, after all that time, was able to quit heroing.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:10.250
Okay. Where to start?

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:17.130
<b>I'm Quitting Heroing</b>

00:22:22.000 --> 00:22:28.250
Bokura no kokoro wa itsudatte moroi
Our hearts are always so frail and fragile<b></b>

00:22:28.250 --> 00:22:34.460
Sore demo mae o muite nagai michi o susumu
But we still face forward and continue down our long road<b></b>

00:22:34.670 --> 00:22:40.080
Shiranakatta koto wa kore kara shireba ii
If we don't know something now, we can go learn about it<b></b>

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:47.000
Tsuzukeru koto no saki ni aru mono ima wa mada wakaranai kedo
We might not know what's at the end of our long, continuing journey<b></b>

00:22:47.380 --> 00:22:53.170
Hitori de kakaekomi suginaide tama ni wa senaka o azuketemiyou
Don't try to do everything yourself, lean on us sometimes<b></b>

00:22:53.420 --> 00:22:56.960
Yowasa ni yorisoeru no mo tsuyosanara
Sharing your weaknesses is strength in itself<b></b>

00:22:56.960 --> 00:23:01.380
Madamada saki wa nagai kui no nai you ni
There's still a long way to go,<b>
</b>so make sure you won't regret anything<b></b>

00:23:01.830 --> 00:23:04.790
Hashiridase riyuu wa tanjun
Dash on! The reason's simple<b></b>

00:23:04.790 --> 00:23:08.250
Tokihanate risou no yume o
Let loose! Make your dreams reality<b></b>

00:23:08.250 --> 00:23:14.380
Fumidashita saki no mirai wa jibun shidai de dou ni demo naru
The future you're heading towards is one you shape yourself<b></b>

00:23:14.380 --> 00:23:20.170
Kawaru koto ga kowakunattemo sukoshizutsu de iinda
It's okay to be scared of change, you can go little by little<b></b>

00:23:20.170 --> 00:23:24.250
Taisetsu na mono o mamoru tame ni
I want to protect the things I cherish<b></b>

00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:26.830
Megurimegutte tsunagatta
(I'm so glad we found each other)<b></b>

00:23:26.830 --> 00:23:31.250
Kimi ni arigatou todoiteimasu you ni
So I hope you hear how thankful I am for you<b></b>
